{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1785994246876758001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"evil-noble-soil","assignee":"","attestations":{"plan-review":{"algorithm":"HMAC-SHA256","author":"Iso Tester","head_sha":"db3be27b493638b3f2a7d1766709d974489da747","key_id":"412fa5372ad877e0","kind":"plan-review","manifest":["plan-review: PASS","ticket: b2bb-2ac7-5ce3-4412","material: 801876aa1e2311db","model: claude-opus-4-8","runner: pydantic_ai","blocking: 0","advisory: 6","regver: 0dbaa5513314ac56","verified-at-sha:db3be27b493638b3f2a7d1766709d974489da747","dep 3fced824bbdd7a0dc9b6c7ad8aaee7d1b32c32f887ad6d759d37aa0e959fbfcc src/rebar/llm/code_review.py","dep 843e6b35e60f2f981a0b7b9001023e3f0d1c43f5707804722ba15c6dcdc754fa src/rebar/llm/completion.py","dep 062e58d88f7fef959800669a43b9f4cb7ff5c70782898986a039e03056116330 src/rebar/llm/config.py","dep 8904ef90b144a5cddf07feffc166e51491ba9df40818ce4ed4103141633e238b src/rebar/llm/operations.py","dep 4642b21be61e558d42b3fe93782f8b52aa0e419e00f3b660addc867cda303c84 tests/interfaces/contracts/test_review_budget.py","dep 73494bc2d8f288c59fe5da9faff2807943995e53f112dfbfd9e941f0adffb35e tests/unit/test_config_llm.py"],"signature":"d6209c30b26b55738db26872ba77d9c7c39e415bab67c77cc82b67156e36435b","signed_at":1782677490153610000}},"author":"Iso Tester","authorship":{"signed":0,"unsigned":8},"authorship_ledger":[],"bridge_alerts":[],"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[{"author":"Iso Tester","body":"Plan-review advisory triage (PASS + signed, 0 blocking):\n- G6 (major) — \"add a per-op floor for the agentic verifier instead of raising the GLOBAL default\": user-DIRECTED to double the default step budget; the global default is the documented knob (REBAR_LLM_MAX_STEPS). A per-op floor in the workflow AgentStepRunner is a larger workflow-engine change and out of scope for this directive. Noted as a future option, not adopted.\n- G1G2 (minor) — `docs/config.md:197` (`max_steps = 25` + the tool-call approximation): VALID, will refresh to the new default in this change (added to scope).\n- G1G2 + T8 (minor) — the `tests/interfaces/contracts/test_review_budget.py` module docstring asserting the default is 25: VALID, will refresh the docstring alongside the assertions.\n- E6 (minor) — no AC ties directly to \"no more INDETERMINATE from the 25-step default\": the failure is LLM-path-dependent (not deterministically testable); covered by the default-value AC + the recorded runtime evidence (c38b: 25→INDETERMINATE, 50→PASS). Acknowledged.\n- P6 (minor) — DET ac-quality heuristic; ACs are individually verifiable. Acknowledged.\nScope add from triage: docs/config.md + the test_review_budget.py docstring.","timestamp":1782677518822481001}],"created_at":1782677227467447001,"creation_channel":"unknown","deps":[{"link_uuid":"744e5d89-b11d-4e13-ba45-7145f0a48dd6","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"5ca8-5993-ca83-40f1"}],"description":"The agent step-budget default is too low for the agentic plan-review VERIFIER, causing routine INDETERMINATE plan reviews on code-grounded tickets.\n\n## Why\n`DEFAULT_MAX_ITERATIONS = 25` (env `REBAR_LLM_MAX_STEPS`, src/rebar/llm/config.py:237) is too low for the agentic verifier (`plan-review-verifier-agentic`), which re-grounds findings against real code with tools. On code-grounded tickets it routinely exceeds 25 steps mid-verify → the `verify` step fails → the gate degrades to INDETERMINATE (`llm_unavailable`) → no signed review → the claim is blocked. Observed this cycle on `tarry-creep-range` (c38b): default 25 → INDETERMINATE; `REBAR_LLM_MAX_STEPS=50` → PASS + signed. Doubling the default to 50 removes the routine flake while staying well under the review-op floors that still apply.\n\n## What / files\n- `src/rebar/llm/config.py` — `DEFAULT_MAX_ITERATIONS` 25 → 50, and refresh the env-doc comment (\"25 ~= 12 tool calls\" → \"50 ~= 25 tool calls\").\n- `src/rebar/llm/completion.py`, `src/rebar/llm/code_review.py`, `src/rebar/llm/operations.py` — refresh the stale \"REBAR_LLM_MAX_STEPS=25 ≈ 12 tool calls\" comments to the new default (the flooring to `_REVIEW_MIN_STEPS=120` / `_VERIFY_MIN_STEPS=240` is unchanged; the \"far too low for review\" sentiment still holds since 50 < 120).\n- `tests/unit/test_config_llm.py` — the default assertion `(16000, 25, 600)` → `(16000, 50, 600)`.\n- `tests/interfaces/contracts/test_review_budget.py` — the `cfg.max_iterations == 25` preconditions → `== 50` (the `>= _FLOOR` assertions stay valid since 50 < 120).\n\n## Scope\nIn: the default value + the stale doc/comment refresh + the two test updates. Out: the per-op floors (`_REVIEW_MIN_STEPS`/`_VERIFY_MIN_STEPS`), `max_tokens`, `timeout`.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] `DEFAULT_MAX_ITERATIONS` is 50; `LLMConfig.from_env()` with no override yields `max_iterations == 50`.\n- [ ] The `REBAR_LLM_MAX_STEPS` env override and the `REBAR_LLM_MAX_ITERS` legacy alias still take precedence over the default (unchanged).\n- [ ] No doc/comment still claims the framework default is 25 (the stale \"=25 ≈ 12 tool calls\" notes are refreshed).\n- [ ] The review/verify op floors (`_REVIEW_MIN_STEPS=120`, `_VERIFY_MIN_STEPS=240`) are unchanged and still applied above the new default.\n- [ ] `make check` + the suite pass (`test_config_llm` + `test_review_budget` updated).","env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/llm/config.py","reason":"DEFAULT_MAX_ITERATIONS 25→50 + refresh the env-doc comment"},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/completion.py","reason":"refresh the stale =25 step-budget comment (floor unchanged)"},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/code_review.py","reason":"refresh the stale =25 step-budget comment (floor unchanged)"},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/operations.py","reason":"refresh the stale =25 step-budget comment (floor unchanged)"},{"path":"tests/unit/test_config_llm.py","reason":"default assertion 25→50"},{"path":"tests/interfaces/contracts/test_review_budget.py","reason":"floor-precondition assertions 25→50"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"774e7ac3-abd7-4e72-9c0f-ed4c99783e15","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"reverts":[],"status":"in_progress","tags":[],"ticket_id":"b2bb-2ac7-5ce3-4412","ticket_type":"task","title":"Double the default LLM agent step budget (25 -> 50)","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["0c31769d-1ef4-4bde-89c2-bd3674b3dfa7","744e5d89-b11d-4e13-ba45-7145f0a48dd6","9a82f802-7369-4448-894c-4494af58021a","4b03af41-4113-4218-a5d7-05c231d503d9","c05e9280-bd5d-4f8c-9c77-5ffcec03ace7","712e7ad5-993f-4974-8300-c51afe794ce1","774e7ac3-abd7-4e72-9c0f-ed4c99783e15","24e17541-afe9-4633-a67e-9b30c8f9fe9b","6ce52a8c-7703-4fbf-b91f-76ce88275432"]},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1785994246876758001,"uuid":"0f15a8af-838f-49b8-9cce-b62296215ab3"}